        ["USAID SEA – Sustainable Tourism Handbook", "https://oneocean.org/sea-indonesia/resources/PUBLICATIONS/Technical%20Materials/USAID-SEA-SUSTAINABLE-TOURISM-HANDBOOK-ENG-FINAL_sm.pdf"]
